     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"clear:both\">Hello Shinyapps.io supports,</p><p style=\"clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"clear:both\">I&#39;ve been developing an app in Shiny and it&#39;s be great. I have one simple question.</p><p style=\"clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"clear:both\">As different browsers have different widths, is there a way to set the rule on resizing the Shiny dashboard based on the following:</p><p style=\"clear:both\">1) If browser width is more than x, limit to width to x and center the entire dashboard</p><p style=\"clear:both\">2) If browser width is less than x, follow default autosizing</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6N1UvcOzSf8/Wi9MFliLhnI/AAAAAAAAAHA/Y9jSmAcvWTMjA8JNvdlh5SZwVfDu0jzlQCLcBGAs/s1600/ShinyWindowOne.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6N1UvcOzSf8/Wi9MFliLhnI/AAAAAAAAAHA/Y9jSmAcvWTMjA8JNvdlh5SZwVfDu0jzlQCLcBGAs/s1600/ShinyWindowOne.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360312377000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2rLkoiMzM4H_hCBTTZiGgO\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6N1UvcOzSf8/Wi9MFliLhnI/AAAAAAAAAHA/Y9jSmAcvWTMjA8JNvdlh5SZwVfDu0jzlQCLcBGAs/s320/ShinyWindowOne.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"252\"></a></p><br><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lmD6RhMh0vQ/Wi9MKV9o5eI/AAAAAAAAAHE/oRm4221BANMm09gFH4qFgdaVjgI5OnqCQCLcBGAs/s1600/ShinyWindowTwo.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lmD6RhMh0vQ/Wi9MKV9o5eI/AAAAAAAAAHE/oRm4221BANMm09gFH4qFgdaVjgI5OnqCQCLcBGAs/s1600/ShinyWindowTwo.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360312377000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1AUou4BQWII5XfrkhD7j4f\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lmD6RhMh0vQ/Wi9MKV9o5eI/AAAAAAAAAHE/oRm4221BANMm09gFH4qFgdaVjgI5OnqCQCLcBGAs/s400/ShinyWindowTwo.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"221\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">The motivation is that I need a fix width so that some pictures are scaled correctly. I hope my request can be done through some div tag on the dashboardPage.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Cheers,</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Donny</p><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
